 the summer when major festivals are held in the city. Although cursed by some horrible post-war buildings, Bristol is nevertheless an amiable, grooved, laid-back city whose mellow vibe is reflected in the music of Massive Attack, Portishead and Tricky that perfectly captures the sultry, lean burn atmosphere of a warm summer's evening in this historic and cultured city.","grounding":[{"source":"wikivoyage","title":"Bristol","url":"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Bristol","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"short":"Bristol is a city in the West Country of England. Clifton Suspension Bridge, Bristol Cathedral and SS Great Britain lead its 12 sights. Plan two days, ideally in June to September.","short_src":"composed","facts":{"population":479024,"visit_h":16.8}},"highlights":[{"id":"hl-clifton-suspension-bridge","name":"Clifton Suspension Bridge","kind":"Bridge","lat":51.45501,"lon":-2.62764,"dist_km":2.1,"sig":2.991,"rank_score":11.24,"resolved_by":"catalogue","fact":"Bridge in Bristol, England","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Clifton_Suspension_Bridge-9350.jpg/960px-Clifton_Suspension_Bridge-9350.jpg","author":"Gothick","licence":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licence_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Clifton_Suspension_Bridge-9350.jpg","ok_print":true},"wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clifton_Suspension_Bridge","heritage":true},{"id":"hl-bristol-cathedral","name":"Bristol Cathedral","kind":"Cathedral","lat":51.45168,"lon":-2.60067,"dist_km":0.3,"sig":2.977,"rank_score":11.17,"resolved_by":"catalogue","fact":"Church in Bristol, England","image":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/West_front_of_Bristol_Cathedral.jpg/960px-West_front_of_Bristol_Cathedral.jpg","author":"NotFromUtrecht","licence":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licence_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:West_front_of_Bristol_Cath